cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived datasets, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "Cold-Season Duration and Cardiovascular Drug Dispensing in Japan: Analysis Code (NDB Open Data)"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0
url: "https://github.com/haruki00430/ndb-cold-exposure-cardiovascular-japan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/haruki00430/ndb-cold-exposure-cardiovascular-japan"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20997810
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for a prefecture-level ecological study (N = 47)
  examining the association between cold-season duration (proportion of the 60
  months in 2016-2020 with mean temperature below 5 degrees C) and cardiovascular
  tablets dispensed per resident in Japan, using NDB Open Data (10th release,
  FY2023) and Japan Meteorological Agency climate data. Release 1.1.0 corrects
  errors in release 1.0.0 (see CORRECTIONS.md).
keywords:
  - cardiovascular disease
  - cold exposure
  - NDB Open Data
  - Japan
  - ecological study
  - drug dispensing
  - spatial analysis
  - epidemiology
